{"id":"vidimo","lemma":"видимо","pos":"adv","rank":577,"glosses":["apparently, evidently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Видимо, это сработало.","en":"Apparently it worked.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to work, to function","l":"сработать"}]},{"text":"Том, видимо, забыл это сделать.","en":"Tom apparently forgot to do that.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Видимо, я был не прав.","en":"Apparently, I was wrong.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Том, видимо, этого ещё не сделал.","en":"Tom has apparently not done that yet.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"not yet"]]},{"text":"Я, видимо, просто не понимаю этого.","en":"I guess I just don't get it.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"I don't understand"]]}]}